# This directory is the optional local drop-zone for a published APK.
#
# APK files placed here are git-ignored (see ../.gitignore) because release
# artifacts are never committed to the repository. In production the file lives
# in external storage — a GitHub Release, an S3-compatible bucket or Vercel Blob
# — and RELEASE_DOWNLOAD_URL points at it.
#
# Keep this file so the directory exists in a fresh clone.
